  "details": "Might be too much if appeared on Poor rated avatars, so I think it would be nice if a warning popped up for a short moment when changing into a Very Poor rated avatar to make the user aware that the avatar they're currently in is poorly optimized. Some people will not care, but some people might pay more attention to a warning than some confusing avatar stats and ratings.\nI think it would help with making newer players wear more optimized avatars and if it's annoying enough to some people, it might get them to optimize their models.\nIncluded some quick MS paint concept art",
